Table full name: MITELMAN.PROD.CYTOGENINV
Column name: Tissue Type: TEXT Description: one of: 'BM', 'TB', 'LN', 'EX', or 'CSF' or (rarely) blank
Column name: KaryLong Type: TEXT Description: if the karyotype description exceeds a certain length, the full string is in this column, otherwise this field is null
Column name: KaryShort Type: TEXT Description: short (possibly truncated) karyotype description
Column name: RefNo Type: NUMBER Description: reference number
Column name: CaseOrder Type: TEXT Description: unknown integer field between 0 and 9638369
Column name: Clones Type: NUMBER Description: an integer between 1 and 58
Column name: InvNo Type: NUMBER Description: investigation number -- always an integer between 1 and 9
Column name: KaryLength Type: NUMBER Description: length of the karyotype description -- can be as long as thousands of characters, but is usually < 30
Column name: InvDate Type: TEXT Description: investigation date -- eg '19730327' or '20170627' but can also be blank or simply '1'
Column name: CaseNo Type: TEXT Description: case number -- usually an intger, but can also be an arbitrary string
